# --- material that must never be published ----------------------------------
# Raw Skyrim textures harvested into k2-texture-pack/raw/: 41k files, 12 GB, each
# one the property of its own mod author. Local working material only; the
# inventory and the provenance list are tracked instead.
k2-texture-pack/raw/*/
k2-texture-pack/raw/MANIFEST.csv

# Verbatim game data extracted from KOTOR 2 (Obsidian / LucasArts / Aspyr).
# The mods ship the CHANGES, never the originals: run each mod's build script to
# regenerate the modified 2DA from your own installation.
**/stock/*.2da
k2-directional-movement/Override/*.2da

# Raw disassembly listings of swkotor2.exe. The findings (addresses, structures,
# call sites) live in the design documents; the dumps themselves are derived from
# a copyrighted binary and stay local.
**/docs/re/*.asm

# Copies of third-party projects kept locally for reference:
#   ref/reone    https://github.com/seedhartha/reone
#   ref/kotorjs  https://github.com/KobaltBlu/KotOR.js
ref/

# A 4.8 MB dump of every file path under the local D:\mods folder. Personal disk
# inventory, not part of the modpack.
docs/2026-09-02-catalogo-mod-skyrim-riferimenti.md

# --- ordinary build and tool noise -------------------------------------------
.venv/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
out/
build/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.dll
*.ncs
*.bak-*
